--
^CONVERSION ERROR$
^.*invalid implicit conversion.*$
A non-viable initializer-list constructor must not be selected for a
braced-init-list, per over.match.list: the const char* element does not
convert to char, so the const char* constructor is selected; a list of
char elements still selects the initializer-list constructor.
